@startuml
!theme plain
title Installment Card Application — Sanitized Workflow Sequence
actor Customer
participant "Banking App" as App
participant "Application Orchestrator" as Orch
participant "Customer CRM" as CRM
participant "Eligibility / Identity Checks" as Checks
participant "Case Management" as Case
participant "Scoring Workflow" as Score
Customer -> App : Start installment-card application
App -> Orch : Check current/recent application
Orch -> CRM : Search last applications (30-day rule)
CRM --> Orch : Found or eligible to proceed
alt Active incompatible request exists
 Orch --> App : Resume or show controlled restriction
else New application permitted
 Orch --> App : Display terms / limit options
 Customer -> App : Choose limit / accept terms
 App -> Orch : Initialise application
 Orch -> CRM : Resolve customer identity / profile
 CRM --> Orch : Customer reference
 Orch -> Orch : Save NON_COMPLETE draft
 App -> Orch : Branch and address
 Orch -> Checks : Validate age, residency, data
 Checks --> Orch : Passed / failed / review
 alt Eligible
   Orch -> CRM : Create or reuse lead
   CRM --> Orch : Lead reference
   Orch -> Case : Register application case
   Case --> Orch : Case reference
   Orch -> Score : Initiate scoring
   Score --> Orch : Accepted or pending
   Orch -> Orch : Transition PENDING
   Orch --> App : Application submitted
 else Not eligible
   Orch --> App : Explain restriction / data correction
 end
end
@enduml